  aciklama: "4. kat, daire 4, bo\u015F ve elektriksiz (\u0131\u015F\u0131k ve karanl\u0131k).
    Dolab\u0131n \u015Fifresi salon duvar\u0131nda fosforlu boyayla: yaln\u0131zca
    kafa lambas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr. Dolapta sigorta; tak\u0131l\u0131nca
    lambalar yanar ve buzdolab\u0131 a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r, i\xE7inde Hasan'\u0131n
    notu ve kat\u0131n anahtar\u0131. Yaln\u0131zca salon ve mutfak a\xE7\u0131k."
